error[SC0409]: this reads `q`, which another argument of the same call writes
   ╭─[ a_write_through_the_address_of_a_pointer_is_a_write_by_name.c:9:8 ]
   │
 9 │     h(*q, *&q = &x);
   │        ┬  ────┬───  
   │        ╰──────────── read here
   │               │     
   │               ╰───── written here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.5 p2 makes this call undefined wherever both are evaluated: 6.5.2.2 p10 orders a call's arguments before the call and not against each other
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign it in a statement of its own before the call
